    "text": "Assuming that no 2s-2p mixing takes place<br >(i)      <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi></mrow></msup><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>  (diamagnetic)<br >(ii)     <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi></mrow></msup><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mat